  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Ausable mean by 'you will see'?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"You will get an appointment with me for tomorrow"},{"id":"b","text":"I have something important you need to read"},{"id":"c","text":"You will witness a dramatic event involving Max and his pistol"},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Ausable imply about the importance of secrecy in espionage work?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It makes it too dangerous for him to be seen with Fowler"},{"id":"b","text":"He believes he is the only one who knows the secret"},{"id":"c","text":"Secrecy enhances his effectiveness as a spy by keeping others unaware of his presence or role"},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Max imply about himself when he says 'you gave me quite a start'?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He was expecting to be recognized as a secret agent"},{"id":"b","text":"He did not expect to see Ausable in such an unexpected place and situation"},{"id":"c","text":"He wanted to make sure Fowler saw the pistol before he used it"},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does the phrase 'you are disappointed' imply about Ausable?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Ausable is happy with his current living conditions and job"},{"id":"b","text":"Ausable expected to be seen as a traditional spy, not an author's inspiration for stories"},{"id":"c","text":"Ausable feels guilty about leading Fowler astray from the ideal of what he imagined a secret agent was like"},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Ausable imply by saying 'you will see'?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"You will see Max with a pistol in your room soon"},{"id":"b","text":"You will receive an important paper that affects history"},{"id":"c","text":"You will be disappointed when you read the paper"},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Ausable do when he thinks Max is about to return from the balcony?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Ausable quickly leaves the room through a back door."},{"id":"b","text":"Ausable pretends to be asleep and slams his bedroom door shut."},{"id":"c","text":"Ausable tells Max that there is no balcony, setting off a plan to get rid of him before he arrives."},{"id":"d","text":"Ausable locks himself in the room with a gun to scare Max away."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In the story 'The Midnight Visitor', who is Max and what role does he play?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Max is a detective investigating a mystery, similar to Ausable."},{"id":"b","text":"Max is another secret agent working for Ausable's boss, trying to sabotage him."},{"id":"c","text":"Max is a reporter sent by a newspaper to cover Ausable's adventures."},{"id":"d","text":"Max is a villain who tricks Ausable into showing him the important paper."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Ausable’s character in 'The Midnight Visitor' is described as different from typical secret agents. Which of these describes a way Ausable deviates from standard agent roles?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Always arriving on time and wearing formal attire."},{"id":"b","text":"Uses humor and wit to avoid conflict rather than relying on force or secrecy."},{"id":"c","text":"Has an accent that immediately identifies him as American and Bostonian."},{"id":"d","text":"Is always accompanied by a female companion for moral support."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$'The Midnight Visitor' suggests Ausable is not your typical secret agent. What does this imply about the story's setting?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It takes place in an entirely modern, high-tech environment."},{"id":"b","text":"The world is filled with romantic and exotic adventures."},{"id":"c","text":"Secret agents are commonly known for their humor rather than danger."},{"id":"d","text":"Secret agents often work alone without any assistance or support."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Ausable mean by saying, 'Presently you will see a paper, a quite important paper for which several men and women have risked their lives, come to me.'?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"This is a reference to the story's plot, where Ausable has hidden the secret document."},{"id":"b","text":"The paper contains information that could influence world events."},{"id":"c","text":"Several people had previously been threatened or killed for having Ausable’s documents."},{"id":"d","text":"Ausable believes he will gain more fame and notoriety from this paper."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$'The Midnight Visitor' introduces a character Max who surprises Fowler. What does this reveal about the narrative structure?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It creates a sense of suspense by withholding important information until needed."},{"id":"b","text":"It allows for a more dramatic and unexpected twist in the story's plot."},{"id":"c","text":"Max is only there to make Ausable appear incompetent, not necessary for the story's progression."},{"id":"d","text":"The importance of Max’s role is emphasized through his surprise appearance."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Ausable meets a character named Max who arrives inauspiciously. How does this contribute to the plot?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It highlights the challenges secret agents face and how they are often underestimated."},{"id":"b","text":"Max’s presence is necessary to deliver the important document to Ausable, creating tension and urgency."},{"id":"c","text":"Ausable uses Max as a distraction to cover his tracks during the surprise visit."},{"id":"d","text":"The story emphasizes that unexpected visitors in Ausable's room usually bring bad news."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Fowler’s first authentic thrill of the day reveal about the characters' situation and relationship?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Fowler finds Max amusing, a character he expected to be exotic but turns out to be ordinary."},{"id":"b","text":"Max is actually Ausable in disguise, foiling Fowler's expectations."},{"id":"c","text":"Max's presence suggests that Ausable has been expecting this meeting for some time."},{"id":"d","text":"The tension between Ausable and Max escalates as they prepare to exchange important documents."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Ausable’s fatness is a significant characteristic in the story. How might this affect his character and actions?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It makes him seem more ordinary and thus easier for Fowler to identify."},{"id":"b","text":"His weight can be seen as a physical manifestation of Ausable's internal strength and resolve, despite appearances."},{"id":"c","text":"Fatness could indicate that Ausable has forgotten about the importance of his mission and is now just seeking company."},{"id":"d","text":"It shows that Ausable cannot travel light or use stealth due to his size."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In 'The Midnight Visitor', why does Ausable claim he was not a secret agent, despite being one?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To protect the authenticity of the story and avoid cliches."},{"id":"b","text":"He feels that the standard portrayal is too dangerous for readers to handle."},{"id":"c","text":"He wants to emphasize his wit over action and danger in his role as an agent."},{"id":"d","text":"Max's arrival suggests he was not involved, thus saving him from suspicion."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does Ausable’s conversation with Max initially reflect the narrator's perspective?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It shows that the narrator is biased towards Max’s character and actions."},{"id":"b","text":"The narrator seems to doubt the importance of the document being discussed."},{"id":"c","text":"The narrator suggests that Max may not be an agent at all, adding to the surprise element."},{"id":"d","text":"The narrator hints that Ausable’s claim of a secret agent is true by his demeanor."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '80947fa1-caaa-4c11-9a63-f20b363ae133', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In 'The Midnight Visitor', what does Ausable's accent reveal about him?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It shows that he might have forgotten to change his speaking style."},{"id":"b","text":"He has an American accent, possibly as a result of being in France for twenty years."},{"id":"c","text":"Ausable’s accent indicates he is not a reliable source of information for the story's plot."},{"id":"d","text":"The narrator believes Ausable speaks multiple languages but mispronounces them."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-29-170Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
